'''Herme''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 530
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Herme
|name2 = Herme CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Herme CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Herme is basically the ideal anti-zombie. Not the strongest, but she's ideal for most situations regarding zombies. Her range is pretty low, rendering her weak against other traits, but it's more than enough for a trait that consists almost entirely of melee enemies. To counter some of her range issues, she has a long range behind her reaching to -800. Because of this, she is able to hit Zombies behind her even if she moves ahead of them, clearing the way for support. She's also slow enough to not get herself into trouble while sniping enemies behind her, but not too slow as limit her overall flexibility. She even has a low cost and quick recharge, further adding to her compatibility.

Herme only has a few vulnerabilities, though they can be troublesome. From her lowish health when it comes to enemies of other traits and her multi-hit causing issues with enemies approaching from the front, you should always make sure your defensive units can do their job and keep Herme from harm. She's also not that good against [[Cadaver Bear|the few zombies]] [[Zamelle|that outrange her]], which does decrease her value by quite a fair amount. Despite that, and a lack of major stats, Herme is far from a bad uber.

